{"title":"For the First Time in Forever","artist":"Frozen","sourceId":"reference:d4cZ7G2Xgpo2RGO8QYek","sourceHash":"d10f109f9b14c5dad55d4e005ec6e05fc4a4fb67c89f37c351451b8901d6847b","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":7.93,"end":10.28,"text":"The window is open, so's that door","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":10.28,"end":12.75,"text":"I didn't know they did that anymore","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":12.75,"end":15.75,"text":"Who knew we owned eight thousand salad plates?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":17.34,"end":19.9,"text":"For years I've roamed these empty halls","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":19.9,"end":22.39,"text":"Why have a ballroom with no balls?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":22.39,"end":25.39,"text":"Finally they're opening up the gates","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":26.72,"end":29.58,"text":"There'll be actual real live people","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":29.58,"end":31.55,"text":"It'll be totally strange","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":31.55,"end":34.55,"text":"But wow, am I so ready for this change?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":35.62,"end":38.62,"text":"'Cause for the first time in forever","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":40.51,"end":43.51,"text":"There'll be music, there'll be light","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":45.12,"end":48.12,"text":"For the first time in forever","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":49.79,"end":52.79,"text":"I'll be dancing through the night","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":54.67,"end":56.75,"text":"Don't know if I'm elated or gassy","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":56.75,"end":59.75,"text":"But I'm somewhere in that zone","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":59.84,"end":62.84,"text":"'Cause for the first time in forever","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":66.22,"end":68.65,"text":"I won't be alone","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":68.65,"end":71.6,"text":"I can't wait to meet everyone!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":71.6,"end":74.38,"text":"What if I meet the one?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":74.38,"end":76.96000000000001,"text":"Tonight imagine me, gown and all","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":76.96000000000001,"end":79.28,"text":"Fetchingly draped against the wall","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":79.28,"end":82.28,"text":"The picture of sophisticated grace","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":83.34,"end":86.34,"text":"Ooh! I suddenly see him standing there","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":86.38,"end":88.72,"text":"A beautiful stranger, tall and fair","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":88.72,"end":91.72,"text":"I wanna stuff some chocolate in my face","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":93.25,"end":95.66,"text":"But then we laugh and talk all evening","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":95.66,"end":98.31,"text":"Which is totally bizarre","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":98.31,"end":101.31,"text":"Nothing like the life I've led so far","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":102.45,"end":105.45,"text":"For the first time in forever","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":106.95,"end":109.95,"text":"There'll be magic, there'll be fun","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":111.63,"end":114.63,"text":"For the first time in forever","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":116.08,"end":119.08,"text":"I could be noticed by someone","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":120.84,"end":123.49,"text":"And I know it is totally crazy","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":123.49,"end":126.22,"text":"To dream I'd find romance","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":126.22,"end":129.22,"text":"But for the first time in forever","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":132.64,"end":135.64,"text":"At least I've got a chance","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":141.38,"end":144.38,"text":"Don't let them in, don't let them see","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":146.35,"end":149.35,"text":"Be the good girl you always have to be","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":151.23,"end":154.23,"text":"Conceal, don't feel, put on a show","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":157.32999999999998,"end":160.32999999999998,"text":"Make one wrong move and everyone will know","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":162.69,"end":165.15,"text":"But it's only for today (it's only for today)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":165.15,"end":168.15,"text":"It's agony to wait (it's agony to wait)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":168.35,"end":171.35,"text":"Tell the guards to open up the gate","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":173.97,"end":176.42000000000002,"text":"The gate","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":176.42000000000002,"end":179.42000000000002,"text":"For the first time in forever","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":179.91,"end":181.11,"text":"Don't let them in, don't let them see","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":181.11,"end":184.11,"text":"I'm getting what I'm dreaming of","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":184.94,"end":187.06,"text":"Be the good girl you always have to be","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":187.06,"end":190.06,"text":"A chance to change my lonely world","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":190.62,"end":191.92,"text":"Conceal","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":191.92,"end":194.92,"text":"A chance to find true love","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":195.33,"end":197.21,"text":"Conceal, don't feel, don't let them know","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":197.21,"end":199.57,"text":"I know it all ends tomorrow","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":199.57,"end":202.57,"text":"So it has to be today","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":202.62,"end":205.62,"text":"'Cause for the first time in forever","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":207.93,"end":210.93,"text":"For the first time in forever","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":214.73,"end":217.73,"text":"Nothing's in my way!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}